ி","tr":"aḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"பெண்டிர்","tr":"peṇṭir","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பெண்","tr":"peṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டிர்","tr":"ṭir"}]},{"text":"இஃதெவனோ","tr":"iḵtevaṉō","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இஃ","tr":"iḵ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெவ","tr":"teva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நெடுவரை","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"tall"},{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"mountain"}],"gloss":"tall mountain"},{"surface":"மருங்கின்","parts":[{"text":"மருங்கு","lemma":"மருங்கு","gloss":"side"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"on the side"},{"surface":"பாம்பு","parts":[{"text":"பாம்பு","lemma":"பாம்பு","gloss":"snake"}],"gloss":"snake"},{"surface":"பட","parts":[{"text":"பட","lemma":"படு","gloss":"to die/perish"}],"gloss":"to die"},{"surface":"இடிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"இடிக்கும்","lemma":"இடி","gloss":"thundering"}],"gloss":"thundering"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடுவிசை","parts":[{"text":"கடு","lemma":"கடு","gloss":"fierce"},{"text":"விசை","lemma":"விசை","gloss":"speed/force"}],"gloss":"fierce speed"},{"surface":"உருமின்","parts":[{"text":"உருமு","lemma":"உருமு","gloss":"thunder"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"genitive suffix"}],"gloss":"of the thunder"},{"surface":"கழறுகுரல்","parts":[{"text":"கழறு","lemma":"கழறு","gloss":"roaring"},{"text":"குரல்","lemma":"குரல்","gloss":"voice"}],"gloss":"roaring voice"},{"surface":"அளைஇ","parts":[{"text":"அளைஇ","lemma":"அளை","gloss":"having mingled"}],"gloss":"having mingled"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காலொடு","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"wind"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the wind"},{"surface":"வந்த","parts":[{"text":"வந்த","lemma":"வா","gloss":"that came"}],"gloss":"that came"},{"surface":"கமஞ்சூல்","parts":[{"text":"கமம்","lemma":"கமம்","gloss":"fullness"},{"text":"சூல்","lemma":"சூல்","gloss":"pregnancy/water-laden"}],"gloss":"fully water-laden"},{"surface":"மாமழை","parts":[{"text":"மா","lemma":"மா","gloss":"great/dark"},{"text":"மழை","lemma":"மழை","gloss":"rain cloud"}],"gloss":"great rain cloud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆரளி","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"abundant"},{"text":"அளி","lemma":"அளி","gloss":"mercy/grace"}],"gloss":"abundant mercy"},{"surface":"இலையோ","parts":[{"text":"இலை","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"not have"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"do you not have?"},{"surface":"நீயே","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"you indeed"},{"surface":"பேரிசை","parts":[{"text":"பேர்","lemma":"பெரிய","gloss":"great"},{"text":"இசை","lemma":"இசை","gloss":"fame/sound"}],"gloss":"great fame"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இமயமும்","parts":[{"text":"இமயம்","lemma":"இமயம்","gloss":"Himalayas"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even the Himalayas"},{"surface":"துளக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"துளக்கும்","lemma":"துளக்கு","gloss":"shaking/causing to tremble"}],"gloss":"shaking"},{"surface":"பண்பினை","parts":[{"text":"பண்பு","lemma":"பண்பு","gloss":"nature/quality"},{"text":"இனை","lemma":"இனை","gloss":"you who have"}],"gloss":"you who have the nature"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துணையிலர்","parts":[{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"companion"},{"text":"இலர்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"they who do not have"}],"gloss":"those without companions"},{"surface":"அளியர்","parts":[{"text":"அளியர்","lemma":"அளி","gloss":"pitiable ones"}],"gloss":"pitiable ones"},{"surface":"பெண்டிர்","parts":[{"text":"பெண்டிர்","lemma":"பெண்டு","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"},{"surface":"இஃது","parts":[{"text":"இஃது","lemma":"இஃது","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"எவனோ","parts":[{"text":"எவன்","lemma":"எவன்","gloss":"what/why"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"exclamatory particle"}],"gloss":"what is this for?"}]}],"literal":"On the side of the tall mountain, so that snakes perish, thundering / with the roaring voice of thunder of fierce speed mingled, / with the wind came the fully water-laden great rain cloud. / Do you indeed not have abundant mercy? You of great fame, / who have the nature of shaking even the Himalayas, / women without companions are pitiable; what is this for?","translation":"O great rain cloud of immense fame, you who have the power to shake even the mighty Himalayas! You come riding on the wind, fully laden with water, mingled with the roaring voice of fierce, swift thunder that strikes so hard that snakes perish on the slopes of the tall mountains. Do you have no mercy at all? Why do you torment women who are left alone without their companions?","modern":"நெடிய மலையின் பக்கங்களில் பாம்புகள் மடியுமாறு இடிக்கும், கடுமையான வேகத்தைக் கொண்ட இடியின் முழங்கும் குரலோடு கலந்து, காற்றோடு வந்த நீர் நிறைந்த கரிய மேகமே! உனக்கு மிகுந்த இரக்கம் இல்லையா? பெரும் புகழைக் கொண்ட இமயமலையையும் நடுங்கச் செய்யும் தன்மையைக் கொண்டவனே! துணை இல்லாத பெண்கள் இரங்கத்தக்கவர்கள். நீ இவ்வாறு செய்வது ஏனோ?","explanation":"In this Kuriñci poem, the heroine addresses the thunderous rain cloud during the night in the absence of her lover. The rainy season has arrived, but her lover has not yet returned, leaving her in deep distress. She describes the terrifying power of the storm, which strikes with such fierce thunder that snakes on the mountain slopes perish, and even the mighty Himalayas tremble. By highlighting the cloud's immense power, she contrasts its grand nature with its lack of mercy toward vulnerable, lonely women. The imagery of the mountain landscape and the overwhelming storm perfectly reflects the heroine's internal turmoil and fear of separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.55],[1.72,1.9],[1.9,3.0],[3.1,3.53],[3.53,4.1],[4.1,4.4],[4.4,4.7],[4.7,5.1],[5.1,5.4],[5.4,5.8],[6.23,6.44],[6.44,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,8.3],[8.3,9.2],[9.2,9.7],[9.7,10.1],[10.1,10.8],[10.8,11.5],[11.5,11.6],[11.6,12.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.75],[1.92,2.1],[2.1,3.6],[3.6,4.4],[4.45,4.8],[4.8,5.17],[5.3,6.3],[6.3,6.5],[6.5,6.7],[6.7,7.5],[7.99,8.23],[8.23,9.2],[9.2,9.5],[9.5,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,11.7],[11.7,12.2],[12.2,13.15],[13.5,13.8],[13.8,13.9],[14.04,14.47]]}}